The bundled colour schemes come from three upstream projects, all MIT
licensed. Their licence texts follow in full.

  schemes/*.toml except Nightfly.toml and Ferra.toml
      https://github.com/mbadolato/iTerm2-Color-Schemes (wezterm/)
  schemes/Nightfly.toml
      https://github.com/bluz71/vim-nightfly-colors (extras/nightfly-wezterm.toml)
  schemes/Ferra.toml
      https://github.com/casperstorm/ferra (ports/wezterm/ferra.toml)

